  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Prerequisites: Card Casting (mana pool, stagnant pool)<br>\nBenefit: as a free action, you may spend one point of mythic power to refund all spell points you have spent since the start of your turn. This free action may be taken outside of your turn. This does not cause Mana Point Cards you have spent to be turned to their original position, and they still no longer count towards the number of spell points you may spend.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting Bonus Content</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-spheres-3#toc65\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
